sequenceDiagram
    participant V as "value: string | number"
    participant TS as "TypeScript 编译器"
    participant Code as "开发者代码"

    V ->> TS: 传入联合类型值
    Note over V,TS: 类型为 string | number<br/>只能访问共有的属性和方法

    Code ->> TS: if (typeof value === "string")
    TS ->> TS: 类型收窄（Narrowing）<br/>在 if 块内 value 类型变为 string
    Note over TS: ✅ 可安全调用<br/>value.toUpperCase()

    Code ->> TS: else (或 if typeof === "number")
    TS ->> TS: 类型收窄为 number
    Note over TS: ✅ 可安全调用<br/>value.toFixed(2)
